    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A Linen Belt",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me: \"Go and buy a linen belt and put it around your waist, but do not let it touch water.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I bought a belt, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "directed, and put it around my waist.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.3",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me a second time:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Take the belt you bought and are wearing around your waist, and go now to Perath",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "and hide it there in a crevice in the rocks.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went and hid it at Perath, as the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "told me.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Many days later the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.6",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "said to me, \"Go now to Perath and get the belt I told you to hide there.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So I went to Perath and dug up the belt and took it from the place where I had hidden it, but now it was ruined and completely useless.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "came to me:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: 'In the same way I will ruin the pride of Judah and the great pride of Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "These wicked people, who refuse to listen to my words, who follow the stubbornness of their hearts and go after other gods to serve and worship them, will be like this belt—completely useless!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "For as a belt is bound around the waist, so I bound all the people of Israel and all the people of Judah to me,' declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", 'to be my people for my renown and praise and honor. But they have not listened.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Wineskins",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Say to them: 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, says: Every wineskin should be filled with wine.' And if they say to you, 'Don't we know that every wineskin should be filled with wine?'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then tell them, 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: I am going to fill with drunkenness all who live in this land, including the kings who sit on David's throne, the priests, the prophets and all those living in Jerusalem.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will smash them one against the other, parents and children alike, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". I will allow no pity or mercy or compassion to keep me from destroying them.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Threat of Captivity",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hear and pay attention,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 13:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "do not be arrogant,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 13:15"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "for the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has spoken.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Give glory to the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.13.16",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.13.16"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 13:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "before he brings the darkness,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 13:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "before your feet stumble",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 13:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "on the darkening hills.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 13:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "You hope for light,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 13:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "but he will turn it to utter darkness",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 13:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "and change it to deep gloom.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
